r creations by toggling the UI off or by exporting GIFs or images to your Documents folder. Use the mesmerizing <i>Tracing </i> color mode to truly liven up your creations. Let the simulation play and put your GPU to work.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137280/extras/7018ce026d411447791eb0de4dfcefbf.poster.avif?t=1693594638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137280/extras/7018ce026d411447791eb0de4dfcefbf.webm?t=1693594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137280/extras/7018ce026d411447791eb0de4dfcefbf.mp4?t=1693594638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
